		line=922,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nmh... nnhhh...”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"It feels like I have been sleeping for a long, long time.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Where... am I?",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"As I cast my gaze around, my heart nearly stops in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Wh-Wha─what is this?!",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Suspended high above the Imperial Palace, I can see all of Tenkyo sprawling out from beneath me.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"By all rights, I should be falling down to the earth─",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Yet I remain suspended in midair, between the two ruined hemispheres of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Finally awakened, I see, Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"A derisive jeer reaches my ears from far below.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"A familiar pair of eyes─devoid of all warmth─glares up at me.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I struggle to lift my arm, but my body refuses to obey in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Powerful chains of magicks are binding me in place.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-Were you the one who did this to me?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Isn't it obvious? I swear, you're just as stupid as ever.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Ah, I remember now.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"I stood and fought at Inner Iseya until Kahaku-san knocked me out.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san, how fares your injury?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“It's fully healed, thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And it's about time I paid you back for that.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What do you intend to do to me?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm a worthless priestess who has already spent the last of her magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Says the priestess who managed to touch the heart of Oomikami Himself. There's still plenty you're good for.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Wh-Why thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, that is beside the point─what do you intend to do to me?!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“You're gonna activate the Barrier for me.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-How so?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I figured I'd use you as a conduit for all the karmic distortions that've been piling up in Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Karmic distortions?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“When you priestesses use your magicks, you channel the karmic distortions into Ne no Kuni, isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But when you do so, you momentarily bind your souls to Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Which means all I need to do is reverse the flow of magicks, and the karmic distortions piled up there will flow right back into this world─”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“In the form of that black snow.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If you do that... this world will...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ehehehee, what will happen, indeed?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I, for one, would love to find out.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The thought of the unimaginably direful consequences leaves me unable to breathe.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"─Two thousand years' worth of karmic distortions washing over the land as a deluge.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"─The denegation of every prayer ever uttered by a priestess made manifest in all its baleful wrath.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Order would disintegrate, chaos would reign, and all the world would be remade in the image of malice and havoc!",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Urgh...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Bile rises up in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hey, keep it down. I'm right below you.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Unfortunately for you, the Barrier remains as broken as it was on the day of the invasion.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is far beyond my power to restore.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Do you think I've just been sitting on my hands these past three years?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Sekka-san tenderly lays a hand on the ruined boulder beside her.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I mean, I can't hold a candle to the priestesses of old, so I\nwasn't able to restore its original function.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“But I was at least able to cobble it back together as a giant refuse heap for spellforce.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Every Artifact consumes spellforce in proportion to its power.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"As a result, only the most exemplary priestesses are capable of activating the most powerful Artifacts.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"And the amount of karmic distortions produced is directly commensurate to the amount of spellforce required...",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The greatest Artifact in the Empire, and a priestess capable of communing with Oomikami directly─what more could I ask for?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Oh, the deluge of karmic distortions will be a sight to behold!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I beg you... please stop this...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“As if I'm gonna stop now, you dimwit.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ne no Kuni is the dominion of our god, Kuronushi-no-Ookami.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Yet you Imperials turned it into your dumping ground,\ndidn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Aahh, aaahh...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The Empire wasn't content to merely subjugate others with its might─it had to defile their gods and trample their faith as well.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And you even had the audacity to pass it off as a morality tale.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“In the Empire's mythology, Kuronushi-no-Ookami was defeated by Oomikami and forced to beg for His clemency, right?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And Oomikami, in all His infinite mercy, forgives Kuronushi-no-Ookami and permits Him to rule over Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Overwhelmed by Oomikami's benevolence, Kuronushi-no-Ookami swears eternal loyalty to Him, and they all lived happily ever after... Isn't that how it goes?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"This mythology is one that every Imperial knows by heart.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
{"font", size=43},
"Considering what I know now from Soujin-sama's account of the Empire's founding, this parable is clearly an allegory for the war between Hi no Kuni and Ko no Kuni expressed as a conflict between gods.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Even though the gods concern themselves not with our theology─",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The hearts and minds of us mortals who worship them are still swayed by such mythmaking.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"─Kuronushi-no-Oomikami swore allegiance to Oomikami, and so, His followers ought to likewise swear their allegiance to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Through its dissemination of this convenient mythology, the Empire subjugated all those it conquered not only militarily, but spiritually as well.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"And even as we profaned Kuronushi-no-Ookami in our theology, we defiled His realm of Ne no Kuni with our karmic distortions...",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“All I've ever wanted was to pay the Empire back for all the indignity it's visited upon Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“And what could be more fitting than for you to drown in your own hypocrisy?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san, I understand your resentments all too well.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“On behalf of all the priesthood, I offer my most sincere apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Despite the chains of magicks binding me, I manage to lower my head in apology.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Don't bother apologizing. I'm not about to forgive you anyway.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As penance, I gladly offer my life to you.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“All I ask is that you not use me as a conduit for the karmic distortions.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Well, well, aren't you just a paragon of virtue, Your Eminence?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Sekka-san's lips curl upwards in a vicious sneer.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Sorry to break it to you, though, but I've lived all these years with only one purpose in mind: seeing the Empire brought to ruin.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'll stop at nothing to reduce the Empire to ash.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, I beg you!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do not involve the lives of innocent people!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even if you do so, it will bring you no salvation!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"I scream, lowering my head once more.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Aren't you ashamed of yourself, bowing and scraping to the woman who slew your predecessor?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Urgh...”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Ah, that reminds me. Restoring the Barrier wasn't all my own doing, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I never could've done it without the help of all those priestesses whose blood still stains these flagstones!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The world beneath me suddenly starts spinning.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"After the war, many priestesses were apprehended by the Republican Army, and not a single one has yet been returned.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Which means, all of them must already be...",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Still feel like lowering your head to me?”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Go ahead, tell me again how I should give up my vendetta in order to save my soul!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"For first time in my life, I realize that when outraged beyond all reason, I am unable to utter even a single word.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"My entire body trembles violently, wracking me with the sensation of being forcibly turned inside-out.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Sekka-san murdered not just my predecessor, but all those captured priestesses...",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"She cannot be forgiven.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"She deserves to─!",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Yes... Those are the eyes I've been waiting to see.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hate me. Despise me. Revile me until you drown in your resentment!”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Then, for once in your life, you'll finally understand how we priestesses of Yagi have felt for two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Sekka-san sneers at me, her eyes full of contempt.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I want to kill her.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I want to bludgeon her to death with all these wretched emotions seething inside me.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I can't wait to hear your screams come tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Now then, Your Eminence, ready to destroy the world together?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Just before sunrise─",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The rhythmic pounding of boots rings out with dignified purpose across the halls of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The cell phone in Elsa's hand lets out a single ring.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's me.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right... Ah, they've arrived. Excellent.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kanami, you're up.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The young girl, sitting stiffly across from her, tightens her expression.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"She lets out a single, long breath, and stands up not as Tokita Kanami, but as Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let us be off.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The crisp, cool air stings her skin.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Yet Empress Hisui makes no move to cover herself as she casts her resolute gaze into the morning mist.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"The sound of footfalls reaches her ears.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Not just one or two sets─",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"But countless overlapping footsteps, as numerous as falling raindrops, all converging upon the courtyard of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Here they come.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"As Empress Hisui lowers her slender chin in a nod, the source of the footsteps comes into view.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Head of House Inou, Inou Hotori─",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Standing at the head of a column of warriors.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Unlike professional soldiers, the warriors do not march in lockstep formation.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Each walks at their own pace, yet their ranks still exude a strong sense of cohesion.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Despite the battle that will soon be upon them, the warriors comport themselves with grace and gallantry, each wearing the same composed, dignified expression.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"For they who live every day in the shadow of death, being asked to step upon the battlefield is of no great concern.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Even should Tenkyo be beset by unprecedented peril, theirs is but to do their duty to the end.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The Republic soldiers surrounding the warriors are subdued by their overpowering presence, looking on wordlessly as they march into the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Placing a hand on Shiranui at her waist, Hotori comes to a halt.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"As soon as she kneels before Empress Hisui, all the warriors behind her kneel as one.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Present in the courtyard are all the members of the Sworn Blades, but also─",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Many of those who cast aside their blades yet nonetheless answered the call.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori and seventy-five other warriors stand ready to serve in accordance with the Edict of the Sun.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“From this moment forth, your lives are in my hands.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The fate of the Empire hangs in the balance, and I expect every warrior to do their duty.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Your Majesty!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"All the warriors lower their heads.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I wish to engrave your fealty upon my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Inou, let each warrior name themself.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“One by one, Your Majesty?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, without exception.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's words set the warriors astir.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Her request to have each and every warrior name themself is a truly unprecedented occurrence.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Save for the heads of the Three Founders, very few warriors have ever been granted such an opportunity.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"To deliver words directly to the Empress herself is an honor that any subject would cherish for a lifetime.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"For these warriors about to go to their death, there could no greater tribute.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Head of House Inou, Inou Hotori, at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Head of House Sarashina, Sarashina Mutsumi, at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Head of House Maki, Maki Kazuma.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“As I am unable to stand, I shall fight this day atop this palanquin.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Seated atop his makeshift palanquin, Kazuma lowers his head.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Due to the wounds he once suffered in the Imperial Palace, he is unable to move his legs.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"One by one, some with determined intent, others trembling with excitement, others still tongue-tied in nervousness, each warrior steps forward to name themselves in turn.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Head of House Ina, Ina Koyuzu, at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"After several minutes, the last warrior finally names himself.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“All your names have been graven upon my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It heartens me beyond words to know that the Three Founders and the Seven Blades are all assembled before me.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“With all due respect, Your Majesty, House Tokita of the Seven Blades is not present.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“It is truly unfortunate.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Peace, good sir.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I assure you, the Seven Blades are all present.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“V-Very well...”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Hotori smiles silently to herself in the same manner as Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"For she knows that indeed, a representative of House Tokita is present.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Empress Hisui raises her head, carefully surveying the assembled warriors.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Forthwith, we shall join hands with the Republican Army to purge the Empire of our common enemy.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am well aware that your enmity towards the Republic has yet to─”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Without warning, the sky splits apart with a thunderous crash.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Loud enough to startle even the most composed of warriors.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"An oppressive darkness descends upon Tenkyo, powerful enough to extinguish the light of the rising sun.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Thick with dread, a violent gust of wind blows through the courtyard, filling everyone's nostrils with the stench of rust and decay.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What in the...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The firmament is wholly blotted out by swirling clouds resembling coagulating blood.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"And at the center of the ruined Barrier, a vortex of chaotic energy extends up into the gyre of clouds above─",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Forming a pillar of blackest shadow.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"All those watching mutely on can only think but one thought:",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"─The end of the world must be upon us.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Such a sight instinctually heralds the same sense of dread in all who witness it, regardless of culture or nationality.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Imperial warriors, Republican soldiers, every last resident of Tenkyo, they all stare dazedly at the maelstrom devouring the crimson sky.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Until─a single, resolute voice rings out across the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Our enemy is upon us.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The kneeling warriors all face forward at her voice.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Go forth to the Barrier!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And in my name, see our foe vanquished!”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"At once, the warriors leap to their feet with resolved purpose.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We seventy-six warriors hereby pledge before Your Majesty that we shall not return until we have vanquished the enemy imperiling our lands!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Following Hotori's lead, all the warriors draw their wakizashi.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“For allegiance!”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"The resonance of the Ringing echoes throughout the Government-General courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"At this clarion sound, Empress Hisui and Elsa meet eyes and share a nod.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republican Army will also make for the Barrier at once!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All forces, prepare for battle!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Following their respective commanders' orders, all those gathered in the courtyard spring into action.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Seizing the opportunity, Hotori approaches Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Have you found Soujin and Miyaguni?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Not yet.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But rest assured that they are already here in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Nodding assuredly to herself, Hotori turns her resolute gaze towards the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Let's get this show on the road.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We know where the enemy is, so all that's left to do is take them out.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let us see the bellflowers bloom once more!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
